<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef generally weak on light to moderate demand and offerings.  Select and Choice round and chuck cuts generally steady, while rib and loin cuts weak.  Beef trimmings lower on mostly moderate demand and moderate to heavy offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>------</p>
<p>198 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p> 99 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>37 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     102.49	102.81	 97.63	 97.19</p>
<p>Changes	  -0.18	 -0.28	 -0.36	 -0.34</p>
